    "detailed_description": "Throwback to the golden age of arcade with this incredible pinball machine. <br>Simple, funny and hard to dominate.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Multiball<br></li><li> Extraball<br></li><li> Jackpot<br></li><li> Original soundtrack<br></li><li> Portrait and landscape mode<br></li><li> Highscore<br></li><li> Realistic physics</li></ul><br><strong>Developer note's</strong><br>Voodoo Doll is a one man studio and this is my first pinball game. <br>Hope you enjoy. <br>Your opinion on the game is very important for us, if possible, review us! <br>This way, we will find what can be improved and it helps a lot by promoting the game.<br><br>Thanx so much<br><br>Alexandre Laredo",
